   injection (jailbreak) attacks, or environment secret extraction against any
   Pamomong Nusantara endpoint.

ARTICLE 05 - ON-DEVICE PRIVACY & LOCAL PROCESSING
MediaPipe 21-point hand tracking webcam analysis, Web Audio API acoustic
synthesis, HTML5 Canvas certificate rendering, and Curation Trail storage
(localStorage key: kelir_jejak_v1) operate 100% locally inside the user's
browser without uploading video frames, biometric records, or advertising cookies.

